* 1\. Meet the following two conditions:

  1. Planned administration of pyrotinib ≥ 21 days;
  2. Grade 1-3 diarrhea after taking pyrotinib, and it is planned to continue taking pyrotinib;

     2\. Age ≥ 18 years old;

     3\. ECOG PS 0-2；

